    <p class="content-note">Airhub's price is per fixed block of data, however long it lasts you; Holafly's is per day of unlimited use. A light user burning under 1-2GB a day will usually spend less on Airhub; a heavy streamer or anyone bad at rationing a cap will usually spend less, and worry less, on Holafly.</p>
  </div>

